  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MAN Embassy Tulip Award 2025 - Empowering Communities Through Legal Literacy, Health Access, and Organizational Strengthening</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As the 2025 Embassy Tulip Awardee, Mujer-LGBT seeks to strengthen its ongoing efforts to create inclusive, rights-based, and community-driven initiatives that address the intersecting challenges of discrimination, limited legal awareness, and barriers to health and empowerment.

While Mujer-LGBT has successfully implemented community-based programs and advocacy work, the organization recognizes the need to sustain and institutionalize these efforts through capacity building, legal empowerment, and organizational strengthening.

This project aims to use the Embassy Tulip grant to build the internal and community capacity of Mujer-LGBT members, volunteers, and grassroots advocates&#x2014;ensuring that the organization&#x2019;s impact remains long-term, community-led, and rights-based.</narrative>
  </description>
